{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Before you became the cook everyone in Grimshore whispers about, you were just a butcher - chopping meat, sweeping floors, minding your own bloody business.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/extras/42a8b09f6c95b763f5e61d92de3de988.poster.avif?t=1759576844\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/extras/42a8b09f6c95b763f5e61d92de3de988.webm?t=1759576844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/extras/42a8b09f6c95b763f5e61d92de3de988.mp4?t=1759576844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until one night, things went wrong. Maybe you stayed too long after closing. Perhaps you cut the wrong thing... or the wrong person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, you\u2019re on the run, trying to disappear and start over somewhere no one knows your name.</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFirst Cut\u201d is the playable prologue to Meat Grinder, introducing the story of how it all began \u2014 before the shop, before the secrets, before Grimshore swallowed you whole.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502230?t=1759576844","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/66bd2cfaddfdfbdbd003bfb7027c457031f0dd2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759576844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502230/0e8859ef336da69ca2847701f491282998a80d12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759576844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta